    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "For MyCorp, the process begins by entering expenses."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "After entering expenses, the next step is to generate a spreadsheet."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "Once the spreadsheet is generated, the request can be approved or disapproved."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the request is not approved, the process goes back to entering expenses."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "However, if the request is approved, the expenses can be paid out."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "The process then checks again if the request is approved or not."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "If it is not approved, the process goes back to entering expenses."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "But if it is approved, the expenses can be paid out."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
